::Q001::[markdown]πέμψαιμεν:{
	~%100%aorist (1) active optative 1st pl. of the verb “I send”#Correct: **πέμψαιμεν** is aorist (1) active optative 1st pl. of the verb “I send” (Chapter 3).
	~%-100%aorist (1) active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I loosen”#Incorrect. The aorist (1) active indicative 1st pl. of the verb “I loosen” is **ἐλύσαμεν** (Ch. 2).
